		TITLE	'Firmware History';	This EdAsm/Asm816 source code file was converted to AsmIIGS;	by EdAsmCvtIIGS version 1.2d8 on 5/16/91 at 9:15:58 PM******************************************************************                                                               **     NOTE:   This firmware was developed using the firmware    **             developed by Mike Askins, for the Unidisk 3.5     **             controller board as a starting point.             **                                                               *******************************************************************                                                               **  Modification History:                                        **                                                               ** Rel  Date       Who  Action                                   ** ------------------------------------------------------------- ** *** 02 Oct 85   G.A. Development cycle    0.01                ** 1.0 31-Jan-86   G.A. Alpha release of Unified 1.0 firmware    ** 1.1 15-Apr-86   G.A. Beta 2.0 release of unified firmwave     **                      1. Fixed a status DIB volume size bug.   **                      2. FIxed a status DIB version bug.       **                      3. Implemented disk swapped error check  ** 2.0 13-Oct-86   G.A. Rom rev. 2.0 bug fixes                   **                      1. Fixed the Mac read/write block calls  ** 2.0 19-Nov-86   G.A. Rom rev. 2.0 added two status calls.     **                      Get.vars, Get.buff.addr.                 **                      1. Returns the start of internal vars.   **                      2. Returns the start of work buffers.    ** 2.0 27-Feb-87   G.A. Rom rev. 2.0 general status byte & swap  **                      1. The general status byte returned on   **                         status call (code $00) now will have  **                         the LSB set if the media has been     **                         switched.                             **                                                               ** 3.0 15-Aug-88   JOA  Rom Rev 3.0 for 'Rev D' IIgs revision    **                      1. Added Direct Read & FastBufr routines **                      2. ReCoded GCR Format to use rpt count   **                      3. Eliminated unused $E1 and Zpg labels  **                      4. Moved xlvtab to $E10F00 from zpag     **                      5. New MergeIt; separate 512 case code   **                      6. Added volume status and eject handling**                      7. Added timeout to WaitReady and errors * *                      8. Added RawRead Call with Raw&Sect modes**                      9. Added TrkRead Call for n whole trkrds **                     10. Fixed FastBufr fast bank spanned rdbug**                     11. Modified Status Call to return devtype**                         different for extended and std/prodos **                     12. Changed XSP Status call to preserve   **                         MotorON rather than always canceling. **                                                               ******************************************************************